# ::tok The first byte of a four - byte character is encoded as 0x81 1 0xFE ; the second is encoded as 0x30 1 0x39 ; the third is encoded as 0x81 1 0xFE ; and the fourth is encoded as 0x30 1 0x39 . i.e. 0x 81308130 0x 81308130 ; 0x 81308230 0x 81308239 ; 0x 81308230 ; 0x 81308239 ; 0x 8130 FE39 ; 0x 81318130 ; 0x 81318139 ; Oo2douolag0c " 0 0x 81308239 ; 0x 81318130 0x 81318139 0x 81308239 0x 8130 FEFE30 a 0x 8130 FE39 ; 0x 81318130 a 0x 81318139 ; Oo2douolag0c " 0URo 23061393 0xFE39FE30 a 0xFE39FE39 .
