# ::tok The report argues that the content ecology of the e - commerce industry is a comprehensive concept that integrates e - commerce with content , but not all content can be integrated with e - commerce , and that good PGC ( professionally produced content ) and UGC ( user - originated content ) are the high - quality carriers of integration with e - commerce , and the higher the value of the content platforms , the richer the scenarios of consumption and promotion , and the higher the possibilities of e - commerce implantation . The stronger the commercial value , the higher the proportion of e - commerce content production and content consumption distributed by this gradual integration of the public and private spheres .
