# ::tok MGTO organized a large - scale Hong Kong delegation comprising over 100 members from the tourism sector , travel trade and media representatives of the Hong Kong Government to Macau . In addition to working meetings and trade negotiations , the Hong Kong travel trade and media representatives visited a number of tourist attractions , hotels and tourism - related facilities in Macau in batches during the two - day ( 10th and 11th ) programme , so as to introduce the latest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market and promote the cultural and tourism linkage between the two places at the same time . At the same time , it will also promote the cultural and tourism linkage between the two places , and jointly develop the market of " joint tours " between Hong Kong and Macau .
