# ::tok BEIJING , Feb. 10 ( Xinhua ) -- Newly admitted members , alternate members of the Central Committee and major leading cadres at the provincial ministerial level studied and implemented Xi Jinping 's Thought of Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era and the spirit of the Party 's 20th National Congress in the afternoon of the 10th at the Central Party School ( the National School of Administration ) to conclude , the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China ( CPC ) Central Committee Secretariat Secretary Cai Qi attended the closing ceremony and made a concluding speech .
